# Netlib fdlibm reference sources, pinned by SHA-256.
# Each file below is fetched from https://www.netlib.org/fdlibm/<name> (HTTPS only; see
# gen-explog-goldens.sh / gen-trig-goldens.sh) and copied byte-for-byte into upstream/ — never
