# 2026-08-23 (change 3, deterministic-math). Classic netlib fdlibm has no e_log2.c (confirmed:
# https://www.netlib.org/fdlibm/e_log2.c returns HTTP 404) — detLog2 is derived, not pinned;
# see the provenance note on `detLog2` in Sources/ElysiumCore/Core/DetMath.swift.
